  <h1 class="article-title">Lars von Kolzenberg</h1>
  <div class="prose">
    <p>I build physics-based battery models: cell models for design, diagnostics and aging, and the software that puts them to work. My PhD was on how operating conditions drive SEI growth. Since then I have worked on aging analysis, cell design and swelling prediction in industry, and today on battery modeling at Breathe.</p>
    <p>Charge Tanks is where I write down, from scratch, how I think about cells. It is a notebook, not a product.</p>
  </div>
